Explanation: The theatrical release date in Germany is now 2026-12-03, and PVOD typically follows theatrical by 45 days. Therefore, the earliest PVOD release date would be 2026-12-28. Since the proposed PVOD date is 2027-01-20, which is before the 45-day window after the theatrical release, it is not yet available. Additionally, since the window has not yet opened, it cannot be published on that date.

